        "snippet": "Aqua Metals (AQMS) Advances Development of Battery Recycling Cam\n\n# Aqua Metals (AQMS) Advances Development of Battery Recycling Campus\n\nGuruFocus News\n\n07/07/2026 06:32\n\nOn July 07, 2026, Aqua Metals AQMS announced significant advancements in its plans to establish the Headwaters ARC, a commercial facility for battery recycling and critical minerals recovery located in the Midwest battery manufacturing corridor. This new project is larger and more adaptable compared to the previously proposed Sierra ARC initiative.\n\n- Market Cap: $9.51 million, indicating a small-cap status in the Industrials sector.\n- GF Score™: 21/100, suggesting the company has several weaknesses that could impact its long-term performance.\n- Insider Ownership: 55.52%, indicating a strong commitment from company insiders.\n\n### What's Behind the News?\n\nAqua Metals is making strides in the battery recycling industry, which is becoming increasingly critical as demand for electric vehicles and renewable energy solution",
