        "snippet": "Aqua Metals Advances Headwaters ARC, a Scaled Midwest Battery Recycling Campus Targeting the LFP Manufacturing Corridor - PRISM MarketView\n\nCritical Metals\n\nNew Energy\n\n# Aqua Metals Advances Headwaters ARC, a Scaled Midwest Battery Recycling Campus Targeting the LFP Manufacturing Corridor\n\nJuly 07, 2026 - by Victoria Lambe\n\nAqua Metals, Inc. (NASDAQ: AQMS), a sustainable critical minerals recovery and lithium battery recycling company, announced on July 7, 2026 that it has entered final site-specific diligence and negotiations for Headwaters ARC, a planned commercial battery recycling and critical minerals recovery campus in the Midwest. The site under evaluation includes approximately 150,000 square feet of existing industrial infrastructure and 50 or more acres of land—more than seven times the footprint and ten times the land area of the company’s previously planned Sierra ARC facility. Aqua Metals expects to announce its selected development path before the end of the current quar",
